            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lucy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty easy dish. Cut large breasts into strips before rolling in butter and crumb mixture. Pressed extra crumbs onto strips. Great leftovers! Baked on aluminum foil sprayed with vegetable spray for easy cleanup. Just baked a second time on parchment paper. Easy clean up! Delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2017-08-29T01:06:25.920Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
