            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lauren Peeler Brice"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this chicken for dinner exactly as shown in the recipe except that I had thinly sliced chicken cutlets instead of boneless half breasts. I reduced the cooking time to 17 minutes and I sprinkled the chicken with a little paprika before cooking. It adds some color. There were zero leftovers. Highly successful at our house.",
            "datePublished": "2017-02-07T23:24:30.117Z"
          },
          {
