            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Andrew Burns"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! The only changes I made were to add rosemary and used 1/2 cup of Parm instead of 1/3. Also used another reviewer’s idea to pour the remaining garlic butter around the breasts in the pan. Came out very juicy and flavorful. Family loved it.",
            "datePublished": "2019-08-16T12:41:10.467Z"
          },
          {
