            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Diana Woodside"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve made a very similar recipe only instead of using melted butter, using a basting brush, coat the chicken with mayonnaise. If you are carb counting replace the bread crumbs with crushed pork rinds. Trust me, it sounds disgusting, but wow, these are fabulous as a coating.",
