            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really Tasty recipe. I did add a little extra Parmesan to the mix, as a personal preference. Instead of using a baking dish I melted the butter with garlic in my favorite cast iron skillet. After coating the chicken I placed in back in the skillet and put in right in the oven. Gave it a little extra crunch. Also, for the last minute I melted some mozzarella and put it under the broiler to melt down. Served with marinara and angel hair pasta and a caesar salad.",
            "datePublished": "2016-05-26T21:39:45.900Z"
          },
          {
