            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cheri"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This chicken is delicious! I used converted amounts of dried spices instead of fresh, and baked the giant \"chicken breasts on steroids\" from Sam's Club at 450 (yes, that's a 4) for about 45 minutes to internal temp of 165. Will definitely be making again. I think I'll try spraying the chix with butter flavored cooking spray and adding garlic powder to the breadcrumb mixture and see how that turns out.",
