            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Spayne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used chicken thighs, Italian seasoning mix instead of fresh herbs, Mrs Dash Garlic seasoning with the butter and garlic, seasoned panko with a little seasoned bread crumbs mixed with it. I read the reviews while it was cooking and seen the suggestion to cook it on a rack so that both sides are crispy so half way through I turned and put it on a rack. Definitely a good idea. Didn't really taste the cheese, would probably add some mozzarella next time. Will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2019-07-28T22:08:47.237Z"
          },
