              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KJ"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been making this recipe for 13 years now. I love it. I pound out the chicken breasts so they are thinner and take less time to bake. I set the oven to about 180-200C(350-400F) . I don't know how long it takes to bake but when the crust is brown I take it out and cut the breast to see if it's cooked through. From memory it takes about 30-40 minutes to bake this way.",
