            "reviewBody": "I was a bit skeptical approaching this recipe as I had a quite bit of disappointment with herb mixes but this one turned out to be a crowd pleaser. Parmesan also makes the whole dish level up to delicious. With the crunchy crust and the juicy chicken, I’m now a proud member of team herb mix !",
